msgid "maxframe.liteframe.LiteFrame"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.initializer.LiteFrame:1 of
msgid ""
"A performance-dedicated, lazy, distributed tabular data object with no "
"index semantics."
msgstr "一个专为性能设计、延迟计算、分布式处理的表格数据对象，无索引语义。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.initializer.LiteFrame:3 of
msgid ""
"LiteFrame provides a pandas-looking DataFrame API for large-scale data "
"processing on MaxCompute. Unlike a traditional DataFrame, LiteFrame has "
"no row index: all operations are column-based, single-column selection "
"returns a LiteFrame (never a Series), and there is no implicit label "
"alignment between independent frames. Arrow dtypes are used as first-"
"class citizens so that integer columns with nulls stay nullable integer "
"rather than being silently promoted to float."
msgstr ""
"LiteFrame 为 MaxCompute 上的大规模数据处理提供了类似 pandas 的 DataFrame "
"API。与传统 DataFrame 不同，LiteFrame 没有行索引：所有操作都是基于列的，"
"单列选择返回 LiteFrame（而不是 Series），独立框架之间没有隐式的标签对齐。"
"Arrow 数据类型作为一等公民使用，因此带有空值的整数列保持可空整数类型，而"
"不会被静默提升为浮点数。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.initializer.LiteFrame:11 of
msgid ""
"By removing index overhead and embedding element-wise expressions in a "
"small set of fusible operators, LiteFrame achieves lower planning cost "
"and higher execution throughput."
msgstr ""
"通过消除索引开销并将逐元素表达式嵌入到一组可融合算子中，LiteFrame 实现了"
"更低的规划成本和更高的执行吞吐量。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.initializer.LiteFrame:15 of
msgid ""
"Operations are lazy — they build a computation graph that is executed on "
"demand via ``.execute()``. Row order is preserved through execution "
"unless an operator explicitly reorders rows."
msgstr "操作是延迟的——它们构建一个计算图，通过 ``.execute()`` 按需执行。除非操作符明确重新排序行，否则在执行过程中会保留行顺序。"

#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/generated/maxframe.liteframe.LiteFrame.rst
msgid "参数"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.initializer.LiteFrame:19 of
msgid ""
"Input data. A ``dict`` or ``pandas.DataFrame`` is converted internally to"
" an Arrow-backed LiteFrame. A tensor is wrapped as a single-column (or "
"multi-column) frame. An existing LiteFrame is returned as-is."
msgstr ""
"输入数据。``dict`` 或 ``pandas.DataFrame`` 在内部转换为基于 Arrow 的 "
"LiteFrame。张量被包装为单列（或多元组）框架。现有的 LiteFrame 按原样返回"
"。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.initializer.LiteFrame:24 of
msgid ""
"Column labels to use. When ``data`` is a dict or DataFrame, this selects "
